# Example kover-rank.py excludes file. Copy this to a project-local path (e.g.
# docs/testing/kover-excludes.txt) and edit it to match your own root build.gradle.kts
# `kover { reports { filters { excludes { ... } } } }` block.
#
# One pattern per line. `#` starts a comment. A `package:` prefix marks a package-prefix
# pattern (matches that package and all its subpackages); everything else is a class-suffix
# pattern — write Kover's `**.*Foo` as just `Foo` here.

# --- class suffixes (data layer, DI boilerplate, generated code, UI/nav plumbing) ---
Api
ApiImpl
DTO
Repository
Module
Exception
App
Activity
Screen
Widget
Dialog
Destination
NavHost
ComposableSingletons

# --- generated/no-logic packages ---
package:com.example.app.strings.generated.resources
